imals-infected-with-influenza-ah5","verified":"The guidance covers prevention principles for human infection.","quality_score":"4","adoption":"AVIAN_H5_02","direct_score_input":false},{"row":143,"status":"PASS_AVIAN_H5_03","source":"UKHSA influenza A(H5) exposure management","url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/avian-influenza-managing-human-exposures-to-incidents-in-birds-or-animals/guidance-for-the-management-of-people-exposed-to-birds-or-other-animals-infected-with-influenza-ah5","verified":"It defines relevant animal cases and types of zoonotic human exposure.","quality_score":"4","adoption":"AVIAN_H5_03","direct_score_input":false},{"row":144,"status":"PASS_AVIAN_H5_04","source":"UKHSA influenza A(H5) exposure management","url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/avian-influenza-managing-human-exposures-to-incidents-in-birds-or-animals/guidance-for-the-management-of-people-exposed-to-birds-or-other-animals-infected-with-influenza-ah5","verified":"It includes PPE guidance for work with suspected or infected birds and animals.","quality_score":"4","adoption":"AVIAN_H5_04","direct_score_input":false},{"row":145,"status":"PASS_AVIAN_H5_05","source":"UKHSA influenza A(H5) exposure management","url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/avian-influenza-managing-human-exposures-to-incidents-in-birds-or-animals/guidance-for-the-management-of-people-exposed-to-birds-or-other-animals-infected-with-influenza-ah5","verified":"It sets out management of exposed individuals.","quality_score":"4","adoption":"AVIAN_H5_05","direct_score_input":false},{"row":146,"status":"PASS_AVIAN_H5_06","source":"UKHSA influenza A(H5) exposure management","url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/avian-influenza-managing-human-exposures-to-incidents-in-birds-or-animals/guidance-for-the-management-of-people-exposed-to-birds-or-other-animals-infected-with-influenza-ah5","verified":"It addresses management of symptomatic people after relevant exposure.","quality_score":"4","adoption":"AVIAN_H5_06","direct_score_input":false},{"row":147,"status":"PASS_AVIAN_H5_07","source":"UKHSA influenza A(H5) exposure management","url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/avian-influenza-managing-human-exposures-to-incidents-in-birds-or-animals/guidance-for-the-management-of-people-exposed-to-birds-or-other-animals-infected-with-influenza-ah5","verified":"It includes public-health case definitions and diagnostic testing pathways.","quality_score":"4","adoption":"AVIAN_H5_07","direct_score_input":false},{"row":148,"status":"PASS_AVIAN_H5_08","source":"UKHSA influenza A(H5) exposure management","url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/avian-influenza-managing-human-exposures-to-incidents-in-birds-or-animals/guidance-for-the-management-of-people-exposed-to-birds-or-other-animals-infected-with-influenza-ah5","verified":"The guidance is updated as genomic, laboratory and epidemiological evidence changes.","quality_score":"4","adoption":"AVIAN_H5_08","direct_score_input":false},{"row":149,"status":"PASS_WITH_AVIAN_H5_09","source":"UKHSA influenza A(H5) exposure management","url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/avian-influenza-managing-human-exposures-to-incidents-in-birds-or-animals/guidance-for-the-management-of-people-exposed-to-birds-or-other-animals-infected-with-influenza-ah5","verified":"Avian-influenza risk depends on virus genotype, infected species, exposure intensity, PPE, symptoms, host factors, testing and antiviral timing.","quality_score":"3","adoption":"AVIAN_H5_GUARD_09","direct_score_input":false},{"row":150,"status":"PASS_WITH_AVIAN_H5_10","source":"UKHSA influenza A(H5) exposure management","url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/avian-influenza-managing-human-exposures-to-incidents-in-birds-or-animals/guidance-for-the-management-of-people-exposed-to-birds-or-other-animals-infected-with-influenza-ah5","verified":"UKHSA A(H5) evidence is incident-, animal-, person-, exposure-, intervention- and time-specific and is not an exact parcel-level infection probability.","quality_score":"3","adoption":"AVIAN_H5_GUARD_10","direct_score_input":false}]}